### PHASE 4 — JSON Web Tokens (JWT)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Phase 4 — JWT Login (obtain tokens)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/jwt/login/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin123"
}

