### Phase 4 — JWT Protected Request
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/jwt/protected/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Phase 4 — Tampered JWT (Synthesis Challenge)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/jwt/protected/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzkwNDE3NzMyLCJpYXQiOjE3OTA0MTU5MzIsImp0aSI6IjYzY2ZhZDljMDMwNjQyODY5YmYyMGJhMDU4YTVhMWRmIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjIifQ.1HaDbu2adxyr5iy9tMubhuGcEdyudqLHlfLCgEhOez4

