### Phase 4 — Bonus: Refresh Access Token
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/jwt/refresh/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refresh": "PASTE_YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}